# Project specific R8 rules. AGP combines every keep rule file in src/main/keepRules and passes them to R8.
# See https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# opentelemetry-api (pulled in by anthropic-java) references the AutoValue annotation, which only exists
# at compile time. Without this rule R8 stops the release build with a "Missing class" error.
-dontwarn com.google.auto.value.AutoValue
